-A failed delivery is not retried.
+`deliver` returns a `DeliveryResult` with the final `status` code and an
+`attempts` list recording every attempt made (each with its `status` and/or
+`error`).
+
+Each attempt has a 5 second timeout. A failed delivery is retried up to 3
+times in total, with exponential backoff between attempts. A 5xx response or
+a connection/timeout error is retried; a 4xx response is treated as final and
+is not retried. If no attempt succeeds, `deliver` raises `DeliveryFailed`,
+which carries the full list of attempts made.
